WEBVTT

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:00.596
you can have the highest high

00:02:00.636 --> 00:02:03.956
and in the same moment, someone
just says something or does something,

00:02:03.996 --> 00:02:05.556
and it just doesn't feel right.

00:02:05.596 --> 00:02:09.476
It's just wrong and it's just, you know,
high and lows in the same moment.

00:02:09.516 --> 00:02:12.436
And so we're going to come back
to the Walter story later

00:02:12.436 --> 00:02:14.476
because there's a lot more
to unpack there.

00:02:14.476 --> 00:02:16.996
But for now, I just want
to leave that story with you

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:20.076
to kind of set context for what
we're going to talk about today.

00:02:20.076 --> 00:02:22.876
I believe Walter had no ill will
in what he was saying,

00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:25.356
I don't think he even understood
what he was saying,

00:02:25.356 --> 00:02:28.196
which is also part of the challenge
in topics like this.

00:02:28.196 --> 00:02:29.556
But it really affected me.

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:33.156
I worried about not only Walter,